From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 23:41:06 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(delegation): name each subagent's route in results and
 notices

A backend-routed child's result carried its route as JSON only on the
synchronous path; the dispatch handle said nothing, and a background
completion showed one unit-wide model, which misreports a batch on
several routes. Each routed result now has ran_on (route <label>:
<model> via <provider>), the dispatch handle lists runs_on per task,
and every completion block prints the task's route. The default
backend keeps its result shape.
